#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト受注クラス・ジョブ制限</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※本クエストは受注時のクラス・ジョブでのみ進行します。<br><br>スワルナの大蔵のマルルゥは、冒険者のことを待っていたようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung (Job/Klasse darf nicht gewechselt werden)</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Maru erwartet dich bereits.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête avec limitation de job ou de classe</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><i>Il n'est possible de progresser dans cette quête qu'avec la classe ou le job qui a servi à la commencer.</i><br><br>Maru semble impatient de vous voir.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Maru awaits you with an appraising look.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level. Furthermore, you may not proceed with a class or job that is different from when you accepted this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: マーヤーの幻泉で<sheet EObj 2012905 0>を入手
#. de: Am Mayaquell <noun-de EObj 5 2012905 2 4 1> einsammeln
#. fr: Obtenir de la mousse à la source de la Maya
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Obtain clumps of sticky moss at the Font of Maya."
msgstr ""

#. ja: マルルゥに<sheet EventItem 2003410 0>を渡す
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de EventItem 2 2003410 2 4 1></capitalize> bei Maru abliefern
#. fr: Donner les paniers de mousse à Maru
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Deliver the baskets of sticky moss to Maru."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 来てくれるのを待ってたよ。<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>は、泳ぐの得意……？
#. de: Ah, ich habe schon auf dich gewartet! Sag mal, kannst du gut schwimmen?
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, tu tombes bien, je t'attendais. Dis-moi, tu es <if $gn4>bonne<else>bon</if> <if $gn4>nageuse<else>nageur</if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: MARU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_000:1"
msgid "I've been lookin' for you, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. I'm in need of a strong swimmer, and you look like you could keep up with a hippo in the water."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 実は、さっきイェドリマンから帰ってきた仲間が、<br>カーンチャナから依頼を受けてきたんだ。
#. de: Einer unserer Kuriere hat in Yedlihmad einen Auftrag von Kancana angenommen.
#. fr: Un camarade rentré de Yedlihmad a accepté une requête de Kancana.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_001:1"
msgid "A friend of mine just came back from Yedlihmad, bearin' a request from Kancana herself..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: パーラカの里の近くにあるマーヤーの幻泉を、<br>綺麗に清掃できないかと、お願いされたみたいでさ……。<br>なんでも、水中の壁の<sheet EObj 2012905 0>を除去してほしいんだって。
#. de: Und zwar soll er den Mayaquell bei Palakas Ruh von Moos befreien.
#. fr: Elle aimerait que la source de la Maya, près de l'Écoute des Palaka, soit nettoyée de la mousse qui y pullule.
#. speaker: MARU
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_002:1"
msgid "The Font of Maya is in sore need of a deep cleanin', and we─which means <i>you</i>─gotta help. Kancana wants the moss gatherin' along the stone walls cleared away."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ちょうどボクたちも、その苔を利用できないかって考えてたから、<br>こっちからも重ねての依頼ってことで頼みたいんだよね……。<br>採取用に袋を渡しておくから、どうかよろしくー。
#. de: Als ich davon hörte, kam mir die Idee, dass wir das Moos gebrauchen könnten. Hier, bitte nimm diesen Beutel und fülle ihn mit Moos.
#. fr: Ça tombe à pic, puisque j'en avais justement besoin. Faisons d'une pierre deux coups<nbsp>: tu passes un grand coup de balai à la source, et tu me ramènes de la mousse<nbsp>! Tiens, prends ces paniers pour la transporter.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_003:1"
msgid "An' as you know, I don't like to see anythin' go to waste, so I'm thinkin' I might find a use for the moss. Take these baskets with you and bring back whatever you find growin' under the water's surface."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 苔は採取できた……？
#. de: Hast du das Moos eingesammelt?
#. fr: Tu m'as apporté de la mousse<nbsp>?
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_010:1"
msgid "You're lookin' as dry as a hippo bakin' under the sun. Did you manage to gather the moss?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: たしかに受け取ったよ、ありがとー。<br>カーンチャナにはボクの方から、<br>無事に除去が終わったことを伝えておくよ……。
#. de: Prima, vielen Dank! Ich sage Kancana Bescheid, dass der Mayaquell gesäubert wurde.
#. fr: C'est parfait, merci. Je préviendrai moi-même Kancana que la source est à nouveau propre.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_011:1"
msgid "Ah, good─I was worried you'd take one look at them waters and think better of your choices. I'll let Kancana know that the temple should be lookin' a bit more pristine."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 実はこの苔、ヒッポが好んで食べるんだ。<br>栄養もたっぷりで、凄く美味しいらしいんだけど……<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>も味見してみる？
#. de: Das Moos enthält reichlich Nährstoffe und wird von unseren Flusspferden gerne gegessen. <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, willst du es mal probieren?
#. fr: Tu sais, les hippopotames raffolent de cette mousse. Elle est pleine de nutriments, et elle serait absolument succulente, à ce qu'il paraît... T'en voudrais pas un morceau, des fois<nbsp>? Allez, je suis sûr que t'en meurs d'envie<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_012:1"
msgid "As luck would have it, hippos go mad for this moss. An' it don't hurt that it provides them with all the nutrients a growin' 'pot needs! Well, how about a bite?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: なんて、冗談、冗談……。<br>味見用の苔じゃなくて、報酬を持ってってー。
#. de: Ha, das war doch nur ein Scherz! Ich will dich auf keinen Fall mit Moos abspeisen. Hier, deine wohlverdiente Belohnung!
#. fr: Mais non, je plaisante... Tiens, voilà ta récompense.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk123_04573:TEXT_BANARK123_04573_MARU_000_013:1"
msgid "Hahaha! I'm just kiddin'. I know you've got much more refined tastes─maybe you can indulge 'em with this bit of coin? I even know a service that offers fast, fresh grub, delivered right to you..."
msgstr ""
